WEBVTT

00:15.130 --> 00:21.940
Kokoro no mori no naka kimi ni deau koto

00:15.130 --> 00:21.940
I was always dreaming of meeting you

00:16.130 --> 00:22.180
<b>Zettai Shonen</b>

00:21.940 --> 00:26.970
Itsumo yume mitetan da

00:21.940 --> 00:26.970
within my heart’s forest.

00:26.970 --> 00:33.150
Hikari no silhouette sono saki wo mezashite

00:26.970 --> 00:33.150
The silhouette of light guides the way.

00:33.150 --> 00:38.750
Itsuka ai ni furete mitai

00:33.150 --> 00:38.750
One day, I’d like to try and experience love.

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
Kimochi to kotoba niji to mizutamari

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
My feelings and words can be like rainbows and puddles.

00:44.460 --> 00:51.860
Omoiau yasashisa ga michibiku ashita he to

00:44.460 --> 00:51.860
The kindness we share will guide us into tomorrow.

00:51.860 --> 00:57.370
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru kara

00:51.860 --> 00:57.370
With only you here, I can become stronger.

00:57.370 --> 01:03.680
Sora takaku negai wo kanadeyou

00:57.370 --> 01:03.680
My wish will be granted in the heights of the sky.

01:03.680 --> 01:09.050
Nanika taisetsu ka wo miushinawanu you ni

01:03.680 --> 01:09.050
You won’t lose sight of something precious to you,

01:09.050 --> 01:18.330
Kitto motto kagayaku kara

01:09.050 --> 01:18.330
because I’m sure it’ll shine even brighter.

01:18.330 --> 01:23.760
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru no sa

01:18.330 --> 01:23.760
With only you here, I can become stronger.

01:23.760 --> 01:30.140
Ima dekiru koto kara hajimeyou

01:23.760 --> 01:30.140
Let’s start with what we can do right now.

01:30.140 --> 01:35.540
Mawarimichi demo ii jibun wo shinjite

01:30.140 --> 01:35.540
I don’t mind if we take a detour, 
as long as you believe in yourself.

01:35.540 --> 01:44.650
Kitto motto sono saki he to

01:35.540 --> 01:44.650
By doing that, I’m sure we can go even further.

02:21.860 --> 02:23.490
<b>That one up there...</b>

02:25.030 --> 02:26.600
<b>...is more like Bun-chan.</b>

02:35.010 --> 02:36.170
<b>Who are you?</b>

02:43.820 --> 02:45.480
<b>Bun-chan reborn?</b>

02:49.550 --> 02:50.620
<b>Or...</b>

02:52.720 --> 02:53.890
<b>I just don’t know...</b>

03:08.070 --> 03:15.010
<b>The Girls’</b> Small Adventure

03:16.480 --> 03:18.420
<b>A manuscript?</b>

03:18.420 --> 03:23.520
<b>With that deadline, I won’t have time to
get back to where I need to be, so...</b>

03:23.520 --> 03:24.990
<b>Yes...</b>

03:24.990 --> 03:28.430
<b>After you went to the trouble of bringing
this to my attention, I’m very sorry.</b>

03:28.430 --> 03:34.800
<b>B-But... if you’d like to hold an interview
with me instead, I can spare an hour...</b>

03:34.800 --> 03:37.600
<b>Yes. Please forgive my selfish request.</b>

03:37.600 --> 03:39.770
<b>I look forward to working with you.</b>

03:57.820 --> 03:59.020
<b>Hello?</b>

03:59.020 --> 04:00.020
<b>Congratulations.</b>

04:02.330 --> 04:03.530
<b>Doumaru-san?</b>

04:04.100 --> 04:06.330
<b>You sure are the woman of the hour, huh?</b>

04:06.330 --> 04:07.470
<b>Is that sarcasm?</b>

04:07.470 --> 04:08.730
<b>What do you think?</b>

04:09.970 --> 04:11.500
<b>Who knows with you?</b>

04:12.570 --> 04:15.270
<b>I’m relieved.
You sound fine.</b>

04:15.270 --> 04:16.470
<b>What do you mean?</b>

04:17.110 --> 04:18.710
<b>You haven’t lost your objectivity.</b>

04:20.780 --> 04:23.880
<b>If you were all giddy about it,
I figured I’d knock some sense into you...</b>

04:23.880 --> 04:25.450
<b>...but it looks like I don’t need to.</b>

04:26.020 --> 04:29.220
<b>So you were worried about me.</b>

04:29.220 --> 04:31.090
<b>That’s not it...</b>

04:31.790 --> 04:37.060
<b>I was just wondering what you were trying
to do after leaving our local station.</b>

04:37.060 --> 04:39.960
<b>I said I was going to chase
this story, didn’t I?</b>

04:39.970 --> 04:42.030
<b>So you’ll chase it, and then what?</b>

04:44.540 --> 04:47.040
<b>Aim for and eventually make it
to a major TV station.</b>

04:47.040 --> 04:48.010
<b>Think it’ll happen?</b>

04:48.010 --> 04:51.110
<b>Right now... no signs of it.</b>

04:51.110 --> 04:53.980
<b>And?</b>

04:53.980 --> 04:56.210
<b>Right now, you’re the woman of the hour.</b>

04:56.210 --> 04:59.220
<b>All around the country,
everyone’s thinking about you.</b>

04:59.220 --> 05:03.090
<b>You already have more than a foothold in the field, even without belonging to a station.</b>

05:08.460 --> 05:09.760
<b>That was a close one!</b>

05:10.360 --> 05:12.800
<b>I won’t let people use me
and throw me away.</b>

05:12.800 --> 05:15.730
<b>One more thing.
When following a story, don’t let–</b>

05:15.730 --> 05:17.870
<b>Your guard down, right?</b>

05:17.870 --> 05:19.300
<b>I know.</b>

05:19.300 --> 05:21.710
<b>All right. See you.</b>

05:29.710 --> 05:31.780
<b>Tanigawa</b>

05:57.480 --> 05:59.780
<b>Should I really go?</b>

06:03.580 --> 06:04.620
<b>Do you want to go?</b>

06:09.450 --> 06:10.550
<b>Okay...</b>

06:31.080 --> 06:31.980
<b>Kisa!</b>

06:46.690 --> 06:50.860
<b>What happened? You wouldn’t
even answer your cell phone.</b>

06:50.860 --> 06:52.200
<b>My cell phone?</b>

06:54.170 --> 06:58.740
<b>Huh...? What did I do with it again?</b>

06:58.740 --> 07:01.340
<b>Sorry. I’m in kind of a hurry.</b>

07:01.340 --> 07:02.610
<b>Let’s talk while walking.</b>

07:03.940 --> 07:04.680
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:04.680 --> 07:09.650
<b>Currently, due to trains not being
allowed into Yokohama...</b>

07:09.650 --> 07:13.220
<b>...this line, which runs from Kannai to Yokohama, will turn around at the next station.</b>

07:13.220 --> 07:18.220
<b>Those customers who wish to enter Yokohama
should transfer to buses once we arrive.</b>

07:19.490 --> 07:21.090
<b>What do you mean?</b>

07:21.090 --> 07:23.790
<b>Like I’ve been telling you, Bun-chan...</b>

07:23.800 --> 07:26.030
<b>Or, no...</b>

07:26.030 --> 07:29.800
<b>Bun-chan’s remains became one of them.</b>

07:29.800 --> 07:34.670
<b>You mean... it became one of the
things that Aizawa guy had?</b>

07:35.870 --> 07:36.910
<b>Yeah...</b>

07:40.550 --> 07:41.580
<b>Can I see it?</b>

07:50.120 --> 07:51.720
<b>Did you see him?</b>

07:51.720 --> 07:52.690
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:54.030 --> 07:54.830
<b>What do you think?</b>

07:55.530 --> 07:57.860
<b>As you said, it does sort of resemble the ones he had.</b>

07:57.860 --> 08:01.830
<b>But... are you absolutely sure it’s
something Bun-chan left to you?</b>

08:03.070 --> 08:04.800
<b>There’s no doubt about it.</b>

08:06.840 --> 08:08.810
<b>So you don’t understand
this either, Shigeki?</b>

08:20.690 --> 08:23.190
<b>Hey... what do you think that thing is?</b>

08:25.360 --> 08:26.860
<b>I wonder...</b>

08:29.930 --> 08:31.200
<b>It’s kind of like Bun-chan.</b>

08:31.200 --> 08:32.100
<b>You think so?</b>

08:32.100 --> 08:32.730
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:33.700 --> 08:36.870
<b>I wonder if I’ll learn something
if I go directly beneath it...</b>

08:39.140 --> 08:40.200
<b>I’m going.</b>

08:40.210 --> 08:41.710
<b>Bye.</b>

08:41.710 --> 08:42.770
<b>Kisa!</b>

09:04.400 --> 09:06.100
<b>Hello, this is Yamato.</b>

09:06.100 --> 09:07.700
<b>It must be nice to be so energetic.</b>

09:07.700 --> 09:10.670
<b>Well, this is the first time you’ve called in a while!</b>

09:11.400 --> 09:14.640
<b>Ah... well, um...</b>

09:15.270 --> 09:17.340
<b>Hello?</b>

09:17.340 --> 09:19.740
<b>I met with Kisa.</b>

09:19.740 --> 09:22.610
<b>And it looks like she’s heading <i>there</i>.</b>

09:23.420 --> 09:25.450
<b>Where?</b>

09:25.450 --> 09:27.650
<b>Minatomirai.</b>

09:27.650 --> 09:30.320
<b>Directly beneath the thing everyone’s
calling the giant material evil.</b>

09:31.580 --> 09:38.560
<b>Transfer
Bus
Depot</b>

09:31.580 --> 09:37.220
<b>Enter</b>

09:31.590 --> 09:37.090
<b>Truthfully, I wanted to go with her,
but my teacher’s already yelled at me a lot...</b>

09:37.100 --> 09:41.230
<b>And I’ve really been negligent
with my shogi recently, so...</b>

09:37.220 --> 09:37.350
<b>Enter</b>

09:37.720 --> 09:37.860
<b>Enter</b>

09:37.860 --> 09:38.560
<b>Enter</b>

09:42.500 --> 09:45.540
<b>So you feel like you can’t just skip out anymore.</b>

09:45.540 --> 09:46.800
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:49.980 --> 09:52.080
<b>So, what do you need me for?</b>

09:52.080 --> 09:55.450
<b>If possible, I’d like you to hold her back...</b>

09:55.450 --> 09:58.050
<b>M-Me?</b>

09:58.050 --> 09:59.980
<b>There’s no one else I can rely on.</b>

10:01.220 --> 10:02.550
<b>Really?</b>

10:02.550 --> 10:05.690
<b>I know it’s a lot to ask, but–</b>

10:11.900 --> 10:15.900
<b>The phone you are trying to reach
is either out of range...</b>

10:15.900 --> 10:17.740
<b>...not turned on, or–</b>

10:16.400 --> 10:17.740
<b>Hey now!</b>

10:27.580 --> 10:28.750
<b>It flashed again.</b>

10:31.210 --> 10:34.480
<b>Flash Count</b>

10:31.210 --> 10:34.480
<b>Memo</b>

10:34.480 --> 10:35.180
<b>Rieko-chan</b>

10:34.480 --> 10:35.180
<b>Incoming</b>

10:35.650 --> 10:36.390
<b>Hello?</b>

10:36.390 --> 10:39.420
<b>You picked up so fast!
Makki, where are you right now?</b>

10:39.420 --> 10:40.990
<b>In a building near Kannai.</b>

10:40.990 --> 10:44.200
<b>It seems like Kisa’s trying to
get under that huge thing.</b>

10:44.200 --> 10:44.960
<b>Could you lend me a hand?</b>

10:44.960 --> 10:47.430
<b>Sure...</b>

10:47.430 --> 10:48.970
<b>What should I do?</b>

10:48.970 --> 10:50.700
<b>Look for her, and stop her.</b>

10:50.700 --> 10:52.200
<b>Bye.</b>

10:52.200 --> 10:53.470
<b>Uh...?</b>

11:05.550 --> 11:07.080
<b>Excuse me, little lady...</b>

11:09.490 --> 11:11.890
<b>You can’t go past this point.</b>

11:12.920 --> 11:14.190
<b>Why?</b>

11:14.190 --> 11:16.730
<b>“Why?” Because it’s dangerous.</b>

11:16.730 --> 11:18.100
<b>What is?</b>

11:19.230 --> 11:21.270
<b>Are you teasing me?</b>

11:21.270 --> 11:22.800
<b>I really don’t understand why.</b>

11:23.540 --> 11:28.270
<b>You don’t understand? An unknown, enormous object is floating above us.</b>

11:28.270 --> 11:30.570
<b>We have no idea what it is.</b>

11:31.910 --> 11:33.480
<b>So why are you doing this?</b>

11:33.480 --> 11:37.550
<b>Honestly... I don’t know myself.</b>

11:38.080 --> 11:40.280
<b>But this is the law.</b>

11:40.290 --> 11:43.950
<b>And it’s my job to protect the law.</b>

11:43.960 --> 11:45.220
<b>So, please.</b>

11:46.930 --> 11:48.460
<b>Step back from this point.</b>

12:44.320 --> 12:47.320
<b>My, my, my... I found myself a moron.</b>

12:49.190 --> 12:50.120
<b>Riezo...</b>

12:50.760 --> 12:53.090
<b>Don’t “Riezo” me.</b>

12:53.090 --> 12:56.260
<b>What are you doing,
rolling up your skirt like that?</b>

12:56.260 --> 12:59.960
<b>Since I can’t reach Minatomirai from the
train station, I thought I’d go this way.</b>

13:00.600 --> 13:03.770
<b>That doesn’t explain why you’re rolling up your skirt.</b>

13:03.770 --> 13:05.240
<b>It’ll get caught on this thing...</b>

13:06.340 --> 13:08.070
<b>You really are a complete moron, huh?</b>

13:08.070 --> 13:11.580
<b>If you just take this off, you’re set.</b>

13:11.580 --> 13:13.480
<b>Ah, I see...</b>

13:17.080 --> 13:18.920
<b>Hey! Wait!</b>

13:19.850 --> 13:21.720
<b>This area is off-limits!</b>

13:21.720 --> 13:23.190
<b>Even so, I’m still going.</b>

13:23.190 --> 13:24.660
<b>Why?!</b>

13:24.660 --> 13:26.890
<b>I don’t know, so I’m going to find out.</b>

13:26.890 --> 13:28.660
<b>You can’t!</b>

13:31.400 --> 13:33.860
<b>Geez! Kisa!</b>

13:35.000 --> 13:36.930
<b>Umm, excuse me...</b>

13:36.940 --> 13:38.400
<b>Yes? How can I help you?</b>

13:38.400 --> 13:43.110
<b>Did a long-haired girl about my age pass this way?</b>

13:43.110 --> 13:46.280
<b>She probably would’ve been wearing all black...</b>

13:47.510 --> 13:50.180
<b>How are you related to her?</b>

13:50.180 --> 13:52.620
<b>I’m her friend,
and I’m looking for her.</b>

13:55.050 --> 13:59.660
<b>It seems like she wanted to go underneath
that thing, so I thought I had to stop her.</b>

13:59.660 --> 14:00.520
<b>I see.</b>

14:00.530 --> 14:03.590
<b>If you’re looking for her,
she walked off that way.</b>

14:05.530 --> 14:06.800
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

14:08.330 --> 14:11.440
<b>Ah, wait a second.</b>

14:11.440 --> 14:15.240
<b>If you find her, warn her about doing this, will you?</b>

14:15.240 --> 14:16.240
<b>Yes.</b>

