14:28.750 --> 14:32.920
<b><i>It looks like Tanigawa-san is
heading towards Minatomirai.</i></b>

14:34.890 --> 14:37.390
<b>Hey! How far do you plan on going?</b>

14:37.930 --> 14:39.800
<b>Give it a rest already!</b>

14:48.070 --> 14:49.910
<b>It sounds like Bun-chan...</b>

14:51.840 --> 14:54.380
<b>Hey, Kisa... let’s go back.</b>

14:54.380 --> 14:57.380
<b>Riezo, you can head back on your own if you want.</b>

14:57.380 --> 14:59.180
<b>But...</b>

14:59.180 --> 15:00.320
<b>I’m going.</b>

15:02.690 --> 15:04.050
<b>Just do whatever you want!</b>

15:16.700 --> 15:18.540
<b>And it’s Christmas Eve, too...</b>

15:20.410 --> 15:23.410
<b>Geez, why did things have to turn out this way?</b>

15:25.740 --> 15:27.010
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

15:27.880 --> 15:29.180
<b>If you’ll excuse me now...</b>

