15:47.630 --> 15:49.100
<b>Kisa</b>

15:51.270 --> 15:56.070
<b>The phone you are trying to reach is either
out of range, not turned on, or–</b>

16:11.260 --> 16:12.220
<b>Hello?</b>

16:13.330 --> 16:15.530
<b>Got a minute?</b>

16:15.530 --> 16:16.490
<b>What is it?</b>

16:17.930 --> 16:20.130
<b>Umm...</b>

16:20.130 --> 16:24.570
<b>I was just wondering if you knew
where Kisa or Riezo were?</b>

16:24.570 --> 16:30.140
<b>Rieko-chan called me earlier, and I’m also
looking for Tanigawa-san right now.</b>

16:30.140 --> 16:31.880
<b>You haven’t found her?</b>

16:31.880 --> 16:33.780
<b>No, not yet.</b>

16:33.780 --> 16:34.980
<b>I see.</b>

16:34.980 --> 16:36.450
<b>Thanks.</b>

16:36.450 --> 16:38.020
<b>Kobayakawa-kun, you wanna come down here, too?</b>

16:40.420 --> 16:42.420
<b>I’m intending to, but...</b>

16:42.420 --> 16:46.820
<b>Then once you arrive, could you
call me back? Let’s meet up.</b>

16:46.830 --> 16:47.790
<b>With you?</b>

16:47.790 --> 16:48.560
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:48.560 --> 16:50.690
<b>It’s no good if we’re all split up looking for each other.</b>

16:50.700 --> 16:54.000
<b>Yeah. Okay...</b>

16:54.000 --> 16:55.930
<b>Well then, I’ll be waiting for your call.</b>

16:59.140 --> 17:01.670
<b>That <i>was</i> Makki, wasn’t it...?</b>

17:20.630 --> 17:22.760
<b>It’s like the end of the world...</b>

17:23.930 --> 17:25.230
<b>Did you say something just now?</b>

17:25.230 --> 17:29.170
<b>I did! But aren’t you scared at all?</b>

17:29.170 --> 17:30.430
<b>Of what?</b>

17:31.600 --> 17:33.000
<b>Never mind...</b>

17:39.580 --> 17:40.810
<b>It flashed...</b>

17:40.810 --> 17:41.810
<b>Yeah...</b>

17:49.690 --> 17:50.890
<b>Kisa.</b>

17:54.490 --> 17:56.530
<b>Have you been bathing...?</b>

17:57.900 --> 17:59.200
<b>Huh?</b>

18:00.430 --> 18:02.930
<b>I’ve been in my room the entire time recently, so...</b>

18:03.500 --> 18:04.500
<b>Hey now...</b>

18:04.500 --> 18:06.670
<b>Can you still call yourself a high school girl?</b>

